angular overlap method for 16-electron complexes with inverted ligand
ﬁelds at the Td and D4h geometry limits. Total MO stabilization energy
(MOSE) determinations show that despite the d10 conﬁguration, D4h
geometry is favored in an inverted ligand ﬁeld picture.
